{"id":616,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It has a strange physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When attacked, it tightly shuts the lid of its shell. This reaction fails to protect it from Karrablast, however, because they can still get into the shell."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"When attacked, it defends itself by closing the lid of its shell. It can spit a sticky, poisonous liquid."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Hydration","hidden":false,"description":"Cures the Pokémon's status conditions in rain."},{"name":"Shell Armor","hidden":false,"description":"A hard shell protects the Pokémon from critical hits."},{"name":"Overcoat","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage from sandstorms. It is also protected from the effects of powders and spores."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":616,"name":"Shelmet","condition":null,"children":[{"id":617,"name":"Accelgor","condition":"Trade, for Karrablast","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,71],[1,182],[4,51],[8,174],[12,72],[16,522],[20,281],[24,151],[28,202],[32,385],[36,34],[40,105],[44,405],[48,515]],"machine":[213,226,34,405,227,203,412,263,202,385,141,341,182,240,156,496,214,188,173,191,164,390,474],"egg":[38,364,470,170],"tutor":[806]},"cards":[{"id":"rsv10pt5-93","name":"Shelmet","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"93","artist":"Mékayu","img":"rsv10pt5/93"},{"id":"rsv10pt5-8","name":"Shelmet","set":"White Flare","date":"20